        {
          "en": "What comes next?",
          "zh": "什么来下一个？",
          "startMs": 37441,
          "endMs": 39122
        },
        {
          "en": "To help the child to guess what comes next in a sentence.",
          "zh": "到帮助这孩子到猜测什么来下一个在……里一个句子。",
          "startMs": 39122,
          "endMs": 45110
        },
        {
          "en": "Read any sentence from the story, leaving out the last word.",
          "zh": "读任何句子从这故事， 离开出这最后的单词。",
          "startMs": 45110,
          "endMs": 51412
        },
        {
          "en": "The child guesses the missing word and looks in the book to check.",
          "zh": "这孩子猜测这小姐单词和看在……里这书到查明。",
          "startMs": 51412,
          "endMs": 58346
        },
        {
          "en": "Then the child reads a sentence but leaves out the last word.",
          "zh": "然后这孩子读一个句子但是叶子出这最后的单词。",
          "startMs": 58346,
          "endMs": 64753
        },
        {
          "en": "You guess what the word is and look in the book to check.",
          "zh": "你猜测什么这单词是和看在……里这书到查明。",
          "startMs": 64753,
          "endMs": 70741
        },
        {
          "en": "• Have two or three turns each.",
          "zh": "• 有二或者三转动每个。",
          "startMs": 70741,
          "endMs": 73998
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away, or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开， 或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 73998,
          "endMs": 79985
        },
        {
